{"ref":"BDB, עֵין גֶּ֫דִי","hw":"עֵין גֶּ֫דִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֵין גֶּ֫דִי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> Ενγαδδει, etc.; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:62\" href=\"/Joshua.15.62\">Jos 15:62</a>: <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצָדֹת עֵין גֶּדִ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.1\">1 S 24:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְבַּר ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.2\">2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּרְמֵי ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:14\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.14\">Ct 1:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">חַצְצוֹן תָּמָר</span> (q.v.) according to <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.2\">2 Ch 20:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵין גֶּ֨דִי֨</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.10\">Ez 47:10</a>; mod. <em>ʿAin ǧidî</em>, on W. shore of Dead Sea, GASm<sup>Geogr. 269 f., 512</sup> Buhl<sup>Geogr. 41, 164 f.</sup>","next":"BDB, עֵין גַּנִּים","prev":"BDB, עַ֫יִן³"}